            "review_title": "Review at Vegan Store Da Nang",
            "review_text": "agentbey\nPhiladelphia, Pennsylvania48 contributions\n0\nTranquility Foods\nMay 2017 • Friends\nThe owner has a wonderful heart and is dedicated to serving the best. Lovely atmosphere to explore some of the best dishes in Da Nang. Highly recommend the Tamarind Tofu and Coconut Fried rice. The Banana Blossom Salad is AMAZING. I am in LOVE.\n\nVery peaceful location. Menu is in English and Vietnamese. \n\nThis is my absolute favorite vegan/vegetarian restaurant in Da Nang City.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 28, 2017",
